  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release.\n\n- Element Finder dashboard in the Content section, listing every reusable Element Type with its total usage count.\n- Drill down to the content pages that use an Element Type, with published status and per-page usage counts.\n- Per-culture usage breakdown for multilingual sites.\n- Server-side search and pagination on both screens.\n- Go to Page opens the content item in the native Umbraco document workspace.\n- Supports Umbraco 17 and Umbraco 18.",
